# WP-FAR-10 (owner 10-20 scope decision: people far away = skeletal LOD + anim budget + impostor beyond).
# UE 5.5 USkeletalMesh LODs: each LOD its own vertices (FSkeletalMeshLODRenderData) and required bones, the LOD picked
# from FOV-aware screen size (USkinnedMeshComponent::UpdateLODStatus), the skin cache skinning ONLY that LOD's
# vertices. Here: SkinnedMesh::GetSkinnedLODs (vertex range + required bones + influences per level), the record's
# Lod (SkinnedMeshRenderData::Lod, ComputeLOD at submit), the SkinCache dispatch sized by the level's range.
# Readout: editor.log "[SkinnedLOD] entity E: LOD l/n skins V of V0 vertices (from F), B of B0 bones, I influences",
# one line each time the entity's level changes. Scene: CesiumMan (walk clip, plain material - not displaced) on a
# wide ground, the player camera not auto-activated, so the viewport camera is the view.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/WP_FAR10_SkinnedLOD.desce
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Когда run Mode "Select mode"
Когда run Action "Play from Here"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.FOV 90
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,0,500
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,0,-1
Когда advance 1
Тогда far10_near CesiumMan at 5 m fills a good part of the frame, walking (legs apart, not a T-pose); log: [SkinnedLOD] LOD 0 skins all vertices, all bones
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,0,6000
Когда advance 1
Тогда far10_mid at 60 m the figure is small, still walking; log: [SkinnedLOD] LOD >= 1, skinned vertices and bones below LOD 0's
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.FOV 10
Когда advance 1
Тогда far10_zoom FOV 10 at the same 60 m: the figure is large again, walking; log: [SkinnedLOD] LOD back to 0 or 1
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.FOV 90
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,0,30000
Когда advance 1
Тогда far10_far at 300 m the figure is a few pixels; log: [SkinnedLOD] the coarsest LOD, fewest vertices and bones
Когда run Action "Stop"
